  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Metrology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to enable Algeria and Morocco to become members of the Metre Convention and thus to facilitate:&#x2022;	Trade between both Algeria, Morocco and Tunisia (already a member) on the one hand and the European Union (EU) market on the other hand, &#x2022;	Free movement of goods and better cooperation between Algeria, Morocco and Tunisia amongst themselves.Through introducing similar working standards and structured cooperation between metrology institutes from the mentioned countries.This in turn would lead to a better enabling economic environment for small- and medium-sized businesses in these countries and would contribute greatly to more trade possibilities and thus to more employment in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
